WEBVTT

00:32.530 --> 00:38.160
<b>Now, let us take a break,
shall we, Your Highness?</b>

00:38.160 --> 00:43.500
<b>I wonder if my brother is meeting
with King Ordalasse about now.</b>

00:43.500 --> 00:47.880
<b>Tell me, Claudius,
what is King Ordalasse like?</b>

00:47.880 --> 00:49.670
<b>He is one of the Holy Elites</b>

00:49.670 --> 00:52.670
<b>and the highest authority
in the Levetian religion.</b>

00:52.670 --> 00:56.680
<b>As such, he is widely
revered by his people.</b>

00:56.680 --> 00:57.890
<b>On the other hand,</b>

00:57.890 --> 01:01.890
<b>some take issue with his
overzealous policy of <i>jus sanguinis</i>.</b>

01:01.890 --> 01:04.480
<b><i>Jus sanguinis?</i></b>

01:04.480 --> 01:08.440
<b>The right of blood. In today's Cavarin,
lineage is more important than anything.</b>

01:08.440 --> 01:13.190
<b>But this is creating an ever-growing
stock of ineffectual vassals.</b>

01:13.190 --> 01:15.570
<b>It also results in unequal treatment.</b>

01:15.570 --> 01:20.200
<b>Policies toward the freeborn are
lenient but quite severe for others,</b>

01:20.200 --> 01:23.950
<b>such as paupers, slaves,
and others subject to discrimination.</b>

01:23.950 --> 01:29.540
<b>There are even cases of slaves being
hunted and killed for sport.</b>

03:07.470 --> 03:09.770
<b>A secret meeting between
Levert and Holonyeh?</b>

03:09.770 --> 03:14.810
<b>I couldn't grasp every word,
so I can't say for sure.</b>

03:14.810 --> 03:15.940
<b>But I believe--</b>

03:15.940 --> 03:19.280
<b>They aim to attack us here
and claim my life.</b>

03:19.280 --> 03:20.280
<b>Right.</b>

03:20.280 --> 03:22.860
<b>At least I know what's
in Levert's head now.</b>

03:22.860 --> 03:26.870
<b>As for Ordalasse, I think I have him
pretty much figured out, too.</b>

03:26.870 --> 03:28.290
<b>His objective is this.</b>

03:28.290 --> 03:29.000
<b>"Cavarin (formerly Marden)      ● Tholituke"   "Natra"</b>

03:28.290 --> 03:29.000
<b>"Cavarin      ● Torystoria"</b>

03:29.000 --> 03:32.330
<b>"Cavarin (formerly Marden)      ● Tholituke"   "Natra"
"Cavarin      ● Torystoria"</b>

03:29.000 --> 03:32.330
<b>Government policy by
<i>jus sanguinis </i>has reached its limit,</b>

03:32.330 --> 03:34.250
<b>"Cavarin (formerly Marden)      ● Tholituke"   "Natra"
"Cavarin      ● Torystoria"</b>

03:32.330 --> 03:34.250
<b>and his subjects are questioning it.</b>

03:34.250 --> 03:35.290
<b>"Cavarin (formerly Marden)      ● Tholituke"   "Natra"
"Cavarin      ● Torystoria"</b>

03:34.250 --> 03:35.290
<b>So he sought to restore unity by taking
the former Mardenian gold mine.</b>

03:35.290 --> 03:38.760
<b>"Gold Mine"</b>

03:35.290 --> 03:38.760
<b>So he sought to restore unity by taking
the former Mardenian gold mine.</b>

03:38.760 --> 03:41.800
<b>To head off criticism,
he worked behind the scenes,</b>

03:41.800 --> 03:43.970
<b>promising loans to the Holy Elites.</b>

03:43.970 --> 03:47.310
<b>Then he invaded while
we were battling Marden.</b>

03:47.310 --> 03:51.430
<b>He hoped to profit by conquering Marden
while we were fighting each other.</b>

03:51.430 --> 03:54.310
<b>However, his plan fell through.</b>

03:54.310 --> 03:59.820
<b>We unexpectedly defeated Marden
and took the gold mine for our own.</b>

03:59.820 --> 04:05.620
<b>That's when Ordalasse set his sights
on me, the crown prince of Natra.</b>

04:05.620 --> 04:10.120
<b>Your Holy Elite nomination will put you
in his debt and strengthen his faction.</b>

04:11.120 --> 04:12.870
<b>Sorry to disturb you.</b>

04:16.710 --> 04:20.920
<b>I have a favor to ask of you if I may.</b>

04:20.920 --> 04:22.130
<b>Ask away.</b>

04:22.130 --> 04:27.600
<b>I wish to accompany you to
your audience with King Ordalasse.</b>

04:27.600 --> 04:31.680
<b>Do you understand the
situation you are in right now?</b>

04:31.680 --> 04:33.270
<b>I do.</b>

04:33.270 --> 04:36.270
<b>I can no longer seek help
from the Holy Elites.</b>

04:36.270 --> 04:39.320
<b>And an alliance between
Natra and Cavarin is imminent.</b>

04:39.320 --> 04:42.900
<b>My own life and the fate
of our freedom forces</b>

04:42.900 --> 04:44.820
<b>are hanging by a thread.</b>

04:44.820 --> 04:49.740
<b>Then you are very much aware
that I can't take you with me.</b>

04:49.740 --> 04:52.120
<b>I can't let you assassinate
King Ordalasse.</b>

04:52.120 --> 04:55.870
<b>No, you are mistaken.
That was not my intent.</b>

04:55.870 --> 05:00.000
<b>Really? Then why accompany me?</b>

05:00.000 --> 05:04.300
<b>So the Free Mardenian Forces
can form an alliance with Natra.</b>

05:05.510 --> 05:09.260
<b>And why should Natra do that?</b>

05:12.430 --> 05:14.060
<b>I don't know yet!</b>

05:14.060 --> 05:18.100
<b>But it may become clear
if I were to accompany you!</b>

05:18.100 --> 05:21.900
<b>There is still time before tomorrow's
Gathering of the Chosen!</b>

05:21.900 --> 05:25.070
<b>I'll do all in my power to find
an answer to that question!</b>

05:25.070 --> 05:26.780
<b>The answer's no.</b>

05:26.780 --> 05:28.320
<b>I commend your spirit.</b>

05:28.320 --> 05:33.580
<b>But that doesn't obligate me to
take you along, nor do I see value in it.</b>

05:33.580 --> 05:38.670
<b>Simply put, I'm unable to trust you.</b>

05:38.670 --> 05:41.170
<b>You say you cannot trust me?</b>

05:41.170 --> 05:45.920
<b>That's right. Or can you give
a reason why I <i>should </i>trust you?</b>

05:45.920 --> 05:50.050
<b>No, I don't have anything
as handy as that.</b>

05:50.050 --> 05:52.180
<b>However, Your Highness once said,</b>

05:52.180 --> 05:57.440
<b>"Trust gains value when there
is the potential for treachery."</b>

05:57.440 --> 06:00.770
<b>I beg you, take your chances with me!</b>

06:03.480 --> 06:06.570
<b>All right, you may come.</b>

06:06.570 --> 06:08.990
<b>You promise not to kill the king?</b>

06:08.990 --> 06:11.740
<b>I promise!</b>

06:11.740 --> 06:17.410
<b>Only uncultured barbarians bare
their blades during diplomatic talks.</b>

06:19.460 --> 06:21.960
<b>Prince Wein, right on time!</b>

06:21.960 --> 06:28.840
<b>Considering the delicate subject,
I wished to meet away from prying ears.</b>

06:28.840 --> 06:32.180
<b>I have no objections. However...</b>

06:32.180 --> 06:35.850
<b>I am honored to make
your acquaintance, Prince Regent.</b>

06:35.850 --> 06:38.810
<b>My name is Holonyeh.</b>

06:38.810 --> 06:42.860
<b>He's new to my court,
but I've found him to be quite attentive.</b>

06:42.860 --> 06:46.030
<b>He's been serving as
my personal aide of late.</b>

06:46.030 --> 06:48.740
<b>Oh, is that so?</b>

06:51.530 --> 06:56.120
<b>I'd heard the king's popularity was
waning due to his overemphasis of lineage.</b>

06:56.120 --> 06:59.460
<b>But the fact that he has
to rely on an outsider like this</b>

06:59.460 --> 07:03.000
<b>shows how much his
hereditary vassals despise him.</b>

07:03.000 --> 07:04.630
<b>Now then, Prince Wein,</b>

07:04.630 --> 07:08.630
<b>tell me how your talks
with the other Holy Elites went.</b>

07:08.630 --> 07:14.180
<b>They have several conditions
before I can join your ranks.</b>

07:14.180 --> 07:17.100
<b>But overall, I was well received.</b>

07:17.100 --> 07:18.770
<b>Marvelous!</b>

07:18.770 --> 07:23.520
<b>Spoken like a true descendant of
the reticent Caleus, disciple of Levetia.</b>

07:23.520 --> 07:25.820
<b>It's really too bad, you know?</b>

07:25.820 --> 07:30.110
<b>If I had a daughter of marrying age,
I would offer you her hand.</b>

07:30.110 --> 07:32.320
<b>Unless my memory fails me,</b>

07:32.320 --> 07:35.830
<b>was there not a princess here in Cavarin?</b>

07:36.870 --> 07:39.910
<b>She is not mine.</b>

07:39.910 --> 07:42.420
<b>What do you mean?</b>

07:42.420 --> 07:46.170
<b>I provided many of the finest tutors,</b>

07:46.170 --> 07:49.380
<b>but she never showed any promise.</b>

07:49.380 --> 07:54.010
<b>Which led me to believe
she could not be mine.</b>

07:54.010 --> 07:57.430
<b>Oh, but I digress.</b>

07:57.430 --> 08:01.390
<b>I had that unfaithful wife
of mine executed, so fear not.</b>

08:01.390 --> 08:06.610
<b>You won't have to suffer the
company of such a foul presence.</b>

08:06.610 --> 08:09.530
<b>Did you have credible evidence?</b>

08:09.530 --> 08:13.860
<b>Evidence? Of all the silly questions.</b>

08:13.860 --> 08:16.830
<b>She didn't produce an
heir worthy of my lineage.</b>

08:16.830 --> 08:19.160
<b>That alone proves the child she bore</b>

08:19.160 --> 08:23.120
<b>Ordalasse was not descended from
my ancestor, a chief disciple of Levetia.</b>

08:23.120 --> 08:24.500
<b>I see.</b>

08:24.500 --> 08:26.250
<b>What a complete idiot.</b>

08:26.250 --> 08:29.250
<b>His belief that his children
should be prodigies</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:31.800
<b>shows how far he has deified his lineage.</b>

08:31.800 --> 08:35.090
<b>No wonder his vassals don't like him.</b>

08:35.090 --> 08:38.180
<b>I have zero interest
in allying with him now.</b>

08:38.180 --> 08:40.640
<b>So now what?</b>

08:40.640 --> 08:43.060
<b>I got a little carried away there.</b>

08:43.060 --> 08:44.730
<b>Apologies.</b>

08:44.730 --> 08:47.230
<b>No, it's quite all right.</b>

08:47.230 --> 08:51.030
<b>I've always been a bit of a hothead.</b>

08:51.030 --> 08:53.610
<b>Oh my, I nearly forgot.</b>

08:53.610 --> 08:56.990
<b>I have a favor to ask of you, Prince Wein.</b>

08:56.990 --> 09:00.330
<b>I favor, you say? What might that be?</b>

09:00.330 --> 09:03.710
<b>Yeah, it's no doubt about the gold mine.</b>

09:03.710 --> 09:08.340
<b>The second he states his conditions,
I'll cut him loose and head back home to--</b>

09:08.340 --> 09:13.840
<b>Would you loan me some of those
lowly, dirty Flahms you breed in Natra?</b>

09:13.840 --> 09:16.550
<b>May I ask... why?</b>

09:16.550 --> 09:21.010
<b>Of course!
I'd like to hunt them for sport.</b>

09:21.010 --> 09:25.770
<b>I hunted down all of ours in my youth.</b>

09:25.770 --> 09:30.480
<b>I would sure like to try
killing some Flahms again.</b>

09:30.480 --> 09:33.900
<b>You must breed them in Natra
so that you never run out.</b>

09:33.900 --> 09:37.910
<b>And I hear you often have
a fine specimen by your side.</b>

09:37.910 --> 09:42.950
<b>What do you say?
Why not join me for a hunt?</b>

09:42.950 --> 09:48.710
<b>I'm a little bit rusty,
but I'm confident in my skill.</b>

09:48.710 --> 09:51.090
<b>Is something wrong, Prince Wein?</b>

09:51.090 --> 09:54.300
<b>It's nothing, really. I was
just making a calculation.</b>

09:54.300 --> 09:55.630
<b>A calculation?</b>

09:55.630 --> 10:00.220
<b>Yes, but I'm done now,
so you may rest easy.</b>

10:00.220 --> 10:02.180
<b>Tell me, King Ordalasse.</b>

10:02.180 --> 10:05.430
<b>Shall we decide now,
or shall we decide later?</b>

10:05.430 --> 10:08.020
<b>Which would you prefer?</b>

10:08.020 --> 10:10.650
<b>An easy answer for so trivial a matter.</b>

10:10.650 --> 10:13.150
<b>Let us decide right now.</b>

10:13.150 --> 10:16.570
<b>I see. Well then...</b>

10:16.570 --> 10:19.320
<b>Good riddance, Ordalasse!</b>

10:20.490 --> 10:22.490
<b>Majesty! What was that--</b>

10:23.450 --> 10:25.580
<b>Highness, what is...</b>

10:28.080 --> 10:30.580
<b>Right. I see.</b>

10:30.580 --> 10:34.750
<b>I'll keep watch out here.
Be quick about it.</b>

10:34.750 --> 10:37.340
<b>Sure. I'll be done in a jiffy.</b>

10:38.760 --> 10:42.140
<b>Wh-What's the meaning of this?!</b>

10:42.140 --> 10:44.430
<b>This truly was a tough decision.</b>

10:44.430 --> 10:48.060
<b>After all, what I'm about
to do goes against all etiquette.</b>

10:48.060 --> 10:49.310
<b>What are you saying?</b>

10:49.310 --> 10:50.650
<b>However,</b>

10:50.650 --> 10:53.060
<b>you told me to decide right now.</b>

10:53.060 --> 10:55.820
<b>So, I'll do just that.</b>

10:55.820 --> 10:57.110
<b>W-Wait!</b>

10:57.110 --> 11:00.320
<b>I am... I am a Holy Elite!</b>

11:00.320 --> 11:04.530
<b>The blood of a chief disciple of Levetia
flows in my veins! I am King Ordalasse!</b>

11:04.530 --> 11:07.250
<b>D-Don't you know what that makes me?!</b>

11:07.250 --> 11:08.460
<b>Garbage.</b>

11:14.750 --> 11:16.340
<b>Zeno.</b>

11:16.340 --> 11:20.930
<b>Your Highness...
I can't believe you just did that.</b>

11:20.930 --> 11:24.550
<b>Calm yourself.
Now, what shall we do with him?</b>

11:26.010 --> 11:29.890
<b>Finish him yourself if you wish.</b>

11:29.890 --> 11:31.560
<b>Wait! Please wait!</b>

11:31.560 --> 11:34.360
<b>Please! Can you not forgive me?!</b>

11:34.360 --> 11:37.570
<b>I won't ever tell anyone
what transpired here!</b>

11:37.570 --> 11:42.030
<b>I don't think so.
You and Levert were plotting to kill me.</b>

11:42.030 --> 11:44.660
<b>No! That's not true!</b>

11:44.660 --> 11:47.120
<b>General Levert threatened me.</b>

11:47.120 --> 11:49.620
<b>I had no other choice!</b>

11:49.620 --> 11:53.460
<b>You disgust me, you dirty traitor!</b>

11:57.210 --> 12:00.170
<b>I-I know you.</b>

12:00.170 --> 12:03.300
<b>You are...</b>

12:06.300 --> 12:09.310
<b>If you're going to betray
your kingdom, do it right.</b>

12:09.310 --> 12:12.190
<b>Otherwise, it will come back to haunt you.</b>

12:12.190 --> 12:15.310
<b>Thanks for the lesson, Holonyeh.</b>

12:20.940 --> 12:26.410
<b>I guess you could say I killed him
over creative differences.</b>

12:26.410 --> 12:28.120
<b>I see.</b>

12:28.120 --> 12:29.740
<b>Now I understand.</b>

12:29.740 --> 12:30.870
<b>Impressed?</b>

12:30.870 --> 12:32.500
<b>I'm appalled!</b>

12:32.500 --> 12:36.040
<b>Assassinating a Holy Elite of all things.</b>

12:36.040 --> 12:37.500
<b>I can't believe it.</b>

12:37.500 --> 12:41.920
<b>Don't be so concerned, Ninym.
No point crying over spilled milk.</b>

12:41.920 --> 12:45.970
<b>The important thing right now
is to figure out what to do next.</b>

12:45.970 --> 12:46.890
<b>Right?</b>

12:46.890 --> 12:49.560
<b>How can you even say that?</b>

12:51.680 --> 12:53.440
<b>Will they pursue us?</b>

12:53.440 --> 12:56.860
<b>Of course they will. However...</b>

12:58.110 --> 13:01.650
<b>I made things as difficult as
possible for them before we set off.</b>

13:01.650 --> 13:04.240
<b>It should buy us some time.</b>

13:06.820 --> 13:09.030
<b>So, what now?</b>

13:09.030 --> 13:11.160
<b>We work with the Free Mardenian Forces.</b>

13:11.160 --> 13:12.000
<b>What?!</b>

13:12.000 --> 13:16.500
<b>War with Cavarin is inevitable
now that I've killed Ordalasse.</b>

13:16.500 --> 13:22.090
<b>If Marden's freedom forces will ally
with us, we'll take what help we can get.</b>

13:22.090 --> 13:24.720
<b>This has been pure chaos.</b>

13:24.720 --> 13:28.010
<b>I know, right?! Why do these
things keep happening to me?!</b>

13:28.010 --> 13:30.260
<b>Ouch! Don't kick me!</b>

13:30.260 --> 13:33.640
<b>So, did you decide to ally
with their freedom forces</b>

13:33.640 --> 13:35.890
<b>before or after you killed Ordalasse?</b>

13:35.890 --> 13:37.810
<b>Before, of course.</b>

13:37.810 --> 13:41.320
<b>I wouldn't kill him
without thinking ahead.</b>

13:41.320 --> 13:43.570
<b>I mean, I'm not <i>that </i>reckless.</b>

13:43.570 --> 13:44.900
<b>Really?</b>

13:44.900 --> 13:49.870
<b>So this isn't something you
cooked up <i>after </i>you killed him?</b>

13:49.870 --> 13:52.620
<b>Look at me.</b>

13:52.620 --> 13:57.710
<b>Killing him and then coming up with a
plan is the same as having no plan at all!</b>

13:57.710 --> 14:00.540
<b>Your Highness. Are you all right?</b>

14:00.540 --> 14:03.460
<b>I'm fine. Everything go well on your end?</b>

14:03.460 --> 14:06.170
<b>Yes, we obtained evidence
from Holonyeh's residence.</b>

14:06.170 --> 14:08.680
<b>It proves the plot to depose Ordalasse.</b>

14:08.680 --> 14:11.140
<b>I delivered it as you ordered.</b>

14:11.140 --> 14:13.220
<b>Goddamn traitor!</b>

14:17.980 --> 14:23.270
<b>It was but a simple, even dull task.
To think it would turn out like this.</b>

14:23.270 --> 14:27.700
<b>I must express
my gratitude to Prince Wein.</b>

14:27.700 --> 14:32.450
<b>General! There are reports of fires
raging in other districts, too!</b>

14:32.450 --> 14:34.370
<b>Start fighting the fires now!</b>

14:34.370 --> 14:35.950
<b>General! We have a problem!</b>

14:35.950 --> 14:37.080
<b>Now what?!</b>

14:37.080 --> 14:40.540
<b>Sir, there's a disturbing
rumor going around town.</b>

14:40.540 --> 14:43.170
<b>And we have reports
that it set off a riot.</b>

14:43.170 --> 14:45.550
<b>What do you mean, a rumor?</b>

14:45.550 --> 14:46.880
<b>Forgive me, sir,</b>

14:46.880 --> 14:50.220
<b>but it claims you seek
to betray King Ordalasse</b>

14:50.220 --> 14:54.220
<b>and usurp his throne.</b>

14:54.220 --> 14:57.480
<b>How could this happen?!</b>

14:57.480 --> 15:01.730
<b>Was it really a good idea
to render aid to that prince?</b>

15:01.730 --> 15:04.570
<b>What choice did I have?</b>

15:04.570 --> 15:07.110
<b>Besides, King Ordalasse is now dead.</b>

15:07.110 --> 15:12.320
<b>And we have evidence
of General Levert's treason.</b>

15:12.320 --> 15:15.200
<b>With this precious information
in our hands,</b>

15:15.200 --> 15:20.370
<b>it would be a waste if we didn't
do all we could to fan the flames.</b>

15:20.370 --> 15:23.880
<b>As the prime instigator
of this festive chaos,</b>

15:23.880 --> 15:27.130
<b>it's a shame you can't join the fun.</b>

15:27.130 --> 15:30.380
<b>But it worked out perfectly.</b>

15:30.380 --> 15:32.550
<b>As a token of my gratitude,</b>

15:32.550 --> 15:36.010
<b>I am sending you this little gift.</b>

15:37.770 --> 15:40.100
<b>It's a message from the palace.</b>

15:42.730 --> 15:44.980
<b>What does it say?</b>

15:44.980 --> 15:47.320
<b>Natran renegades have risen in revolt.</b>

15:47.320 --> 15:51.450
<b>They've sealed the border
and are out to claim your head.</b>

15:51.450 --> 15:56.620
<b>In the Hagal's absence, the nobility
is showing signs of rebellion.</b>

15:56.620 --> 15:59.080
<b>It's just as the report said.</b>

15:59.950 --> 16:01.370
<b>I see.</b>

16:02.420 --> 16:05.710
<b>Highness, I'm afraid I have bad news.</b>

16:05.710 --> 16:10.840
<b>An avalanche along the
mountain pass has barred our way.</b>

16:10.840 --> 16:12.550
<b>How long till it's passable?</b>

16:12.550 --> 16:17.350
<b>I expect it would take at least
10 days to clear the way.</b>

16:18.640 --> 16:22.640
<b>Raklum, let's move.
Our little break is over.</b>

16:22.640 --> 16:24.850
<b>Have everyone prepare to leave at once.</b>

16:24.850 --> 16:25.860
<b>Highness!</b>

16:25.860 --> 16:29.110
<b>Ninym, bring Zeno to me.
I need to speak with her.</b>

16:29.110 --> 16:33.280
<b>Understood. But Wein, what will you do?</b>

16:33.280 --> 16:36.160
<b>The hunters are about
to become the hunted.</b>

16:37.200 --> 16:39.290
<b>Faster!</b>

16:39.290 --> 16:41.540
<b>We can still chase them down!</b>

16:41.540 --> 16:45.580
<b>General, our advance party is back.</b>

16:45.580 --> 16:49.050
<b>Well? Did they discover
which way the Natran scum went?</b>

16:49.050 --> 16:51.630
<b>Yes, sir! They left
a trail on the highway.</b>

16:51.630 --> 16:53.680
<b>They discarded their baggage!</b>

16:53.680 --> 16:55.930
<b>They didn't take the mountain pass?</b>

16:55.930 --> 16:59.350
<b>That would've been their
shortest route across the border.</b>

16:59.350 --> 17:05.150
<b>It seems there was an avalanche
before the Natrans could pass through.</b>

17:05.150 --> 17:08.940
<b>It's divine retribution for
the Natran prince's evil deeds.</b>

17:08.940 --> 17:10.530
<b>All troops, to the highway!</b>

17:10.530 --> 17:13.570
<b>No, wait! I believe it's a ruse!</b>

17:13.570 --> 17:14.820
<b>A ruse?</b>

17:14.820 --> 17:19.830
<b>Yes, sir! They're trying
to lure us onto the highway.</b>

17:19.830 --> 17:24.290
<b>Meanwhile, they'll take the byway.</b>

17:24.290 --> 17:27.710
<b>That way, they won't be taken from behind.</b>

17:27.710 --> 17:29.710
<b>Impudent scum.</b>

17:29.710 --> 17:33.590
<b>With me! Those fiends
must've gone this way!</b>

17:38.890 --> 17:43.600
<b>Halt! All units, halt!</b>

17:43.600 --> 17:45.770
<b>Who are they?</b>

17:45.770 --> 17:49.810
<b>They're not flying the Natran banner,
and there is no unity to their garb.</b>

17:49.810 --> 17:51.480
<b>Brigands, perhaps?</b>

17:51.480 --> 17:54.280
<b>Do brigands array in such a formation?</b>

17:54.280 --> 17:55.860
<b>Whose army is that?</b>

17:55.860 --> 17:57.990
<b>We're under attack!</b>

18:03.370 --> 18:04.660
<b>What's happening?!</b>

18:04.660 --> 18:05.750
<b>Calm yourself!</b>

18:05.750 --> 18:07.670
<b>Don't initiate an attack.</b>

18:07.670 --> 18:10.880
<b>Our objective is Prince Wein's capture!</b>

18:10.880 --> 18:13.590
<b>Charge! I don't care
if we cross the border!</b>

18:13.590 --> 18:16.420
<b>Prepare to smash through
the formation ahead!</b>

18:16.420 --> 18:18.300
<b>The enemy is charging our line!</b>

18:18.300 --> 18:20.550
<b>Hold fast, men!</b>

18:21.720 --> 18:23.890
<b>Damnit.</b>

18:23.890 --> 18:27.060
<b>Why is Levert there ahead of the prince?</b>

18:28.310 --> 18:30.440
<b>That must be it.</b>

18:30.440 --> 18:35.190
<b>You got me this time, Prince Wein.</b>

18:35.190 --> 18:40.200
<b>You let Levert's cavalry pursuit pass by
and clash with the Natran renegades.</b>

18:40.200 --> 18:43.080
<b>They really fell for Your Highness's plan.</b>

18:43.080 --> 18:46.200
<b>It's one of the oldest tricks in the book.</b>

18:49.040 --> 18:54.250
<b>It wouldn't have gone this well without
the help of the Free Mardenian Forces.</b>

18:54.250 --> 18:57.550
<b>After joining with the
freedom forces at the byway,</b>

18:57.550 --> 19:00.260
<b>we attack our Cavarinian
pursuers from behind.</b>

19:00.260 --> 19:02.800
<b>In the ensuing chaos,
we push them forward,</b>

19:02.800 --> 19:05.560
<b>forcing them to fight
the Natran renegades.</b>

19:05.560 --> 19:09.140
<b>All we have to do now is slip through
the fighting and across the border.</b>

19:09.140 --> 19:11.310
<b>No, this is our chance to crush</b>

19:11.310 --> 19:14.230
<b>our pursuers and the
renegades in one fell swoop.</b>

19:14.230 --> 19:16.990
<b>With our small numbers?</b>

19:17.990 --> 19:19.360
<b>Right on time.</b>

19:27.410 --> 19:28.660
<b>Hagal.</b>

19:33.750 --> 19:35.750
<b>What is Hagal doing here?!</b>

19:35.750 --> 19:39.840
<b>I thought General Hagal retired.</b>

19:39.840 --> 19:41.090
<b>You planned this?</b>

19:41.090 --> 19:46.810
<b>I thought I'd lure the renegades
out and eliminate them.</b>

19:46.810 --> 19:51.140
<b>But I never expected it
to end up like this.</b>

19:51.140 --> 19:54.980
<b>Apologies for getting you
mixed up in this, General Levert.</b>

19:56.400 --> 20:00.820
<b>Your reputation precedes you,
General Hagal of Natra!</b>

20:00.820 --> 20:03.740
<b>--But I am--
--I'm sorry, but...</b>

20:04.450 --> 20:09.250
<b>...there is no need to remember
the names of the unworthy dead.</b>

20:11.160 --> 20:14.170
<b>The enemy general has fallen!</b>

20:21.050 --> 20:24.800
<b>His Highness, Prince Helmut,
Second Prince of Marden, is here.</b>

20:24.800 --> 20:26.720
<b>Very well, show him in.</b>

20:28.520 --> 20:31.270
<b>Prince Helmut, what a pleasant surprise.</b>

20:31.270 --> 20:35.400
<b>I'd say it's nice to meet you,
but it's not the first time, is it?</b>

20:35.400 --> 20:41.280
<b>May I have your name once again?</b>

20:41.280 --> 20:43.780
<b>Zenovia.</b>

20:43.780 --> 20:48.410
<b>Zenovia Marden, Crown Princess of Marden.</b>

20:48.410 --> 20:52.210
<b>It's nice to see you again, Prince Wein.</b>

20:54.830 --> 20:57.090
<b>You don't seem very surprised.</b>

20:57.090 --> 20:59.210
<b>You knew who I was?</b>

20:59.210 --> 21:02.380
<b>No, it was quite a surprise.</b>

21:05.470 --> 21:07.970
<b>When Cavarin attacked our capital,</b>

21:07.970 --> 21:12.430
<b>I was able to escape thanks
to an astute retainer.</b>

21:12.430 --> 21:17.060
<b>I tried to regroup the army
so we could retake the city.</b>

21:17.060 --> 21:19.610
<b>But as you can see, I'm a woman.</b>

21:19.610 --> 21:25.240
<b>However, there was no one else but me
after the other royals were executed.</b>

21:25.240 --> 21:27.870
<b>You might call it a blessing in disguise,</b>

21:27.870 --> 21:32.450
<b>but very few among
our vassals are able to recognize me.</b>

21:32.450 --> 21:36.330
<b>So I became Zeno, aide to the prince.</b>

21:36.330 --> 21:41.050
<b>But the truth is, my father,
the late king, disapproved of my conduct</b>

21:41.050 --> 21:44.260
<b>and had me cloistered
away in a royal villa.</b>

21:44.260 --> 21:49.140
<b>In an ironic twist, that is why I was
the only royal to escape the slaughter.</b>

21:51.220 --> 21:54.850
<b>The Mardenian Freedom Forces
had help from Natra</b>

21:54.850 --> 21:59.190
<b>in retaking their capital from Cavarin?</b>

21:59.190 --> 22:02.070
<b>So that's what happened?</b>

22:02.070 --> 22:05.650
<b>I tried to incite the renegades
and ensure Prince Wein's demise.</b>

22:05.650 --> 22:08.820
<b>If I'd fulfilled the task you
graced me with, Lady Caldmellia,</b>

22:08.820 --> 22:11.240
<b>this would never have happened.</b>

22:11.950 --> 22:15.330
<b>You did just fine.</b>

22:15.330 --> 22:19.080
<b>You are all my precious children.</b>

22:19.080 --> 22:24.670
<b>Without you, I am but an old woman
who loves to make mischief.</b>

22:24.670 --> 22:26.880
<b>Lady Caldmellia.</b>

22:26.880 --> 22:29.890
<b>Now, raise your head.</b>

22:29.890 --> 22:35.180
<b>Let us develop a plan together to bring
even greater ruin upon this continent.</b>

22:35.180 --> 22:38.020
<b>Yes, Lady Caldmellia.</b>

22:44.030 --> 22:48.030
<b>I have a favor to ask of Your Highness.</b>

22:48.030 --> 22:49.410
<b>By all means.</b>

22:49.410 --> 22:51.740
<b>This worked out great!</b>

22:51.740 --> 22:55.540
<b>Marden will now be
our bulwark in the west.</b>

22:55.540 --> 22:58.120
<b>I pulled off a peaceful resolution!</b>

22:58.120 --> 23:00.750
<b>Our land of Marden...</b>

23:00.750 --> 23:05.050
<b>...wishes to swear allegiance
to Natra as a vassal state.</b>

23:06.920 --> 23:08.170
<b>A vassal state?</b>

23:08.170 --> 23:09.430
<b>Yes.</b>

23:09.430 --> 23:14.350
<b>I'm from the Mardenian royal family,
but I'm a woman and lack ability.</b>

23:14.350 --> 23:17.850
<b>I do not have what it
takes to rule a kingdom.</b>

23:17.850 --> 23:22.440
<b>Marden can only survive through
Your Highness's genius and mercy.</b>

23:22.440 --> 23:25.070
<b>I know now that is our only hope.</b>

23:25.070 --> 23:29.240
<b>I beg you. Please let us have
a seat at the end of Natra's table.</b>

23:29.240 --> 23:30.780
<b>Yes, well...</b>

23:30.780 --> 23:34.450
<b>Your Highness, though we once
crossed swords with Marden,</b>

23:34.450 --> 23:37.250
<b>they are now our comrades in arms.</b>

23:37.250 --> 23:38.870
<b>Let us accept their offer.</b>

23:38.870 --> 23:41.920
<b>--What?! No!
--It's been 200 years
since Natra's founding.</b>

23:41.920 --> 23:45.210
<b>Our kingdom is finally
making great strides!</b>

23:45.210 --> 23:47.010
<b>No, wait!</b>

23:47.010 --> 23:49.090
<b>Ninym, help!</b>

23:49.920 --> 23:51.300
<b>No can do.</b>

23:54.100 --> 23:57.470
<b>Sorry, but you said it yourself.</b>

23:57.470 --> 24:02.400
<b>"Trust gains value when there
is the potential for treachery."</b>

24:06.400 --> 24:10.860
<b>What did I do to deserve this?!</b>
